                            <comment id="16554575" author="edshanggg" created="Tue, 24 Jul 2018 17:36:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_IgfsLinuxAndMacOS&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F4423%2Fhead&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_IgfsLinuxAndMacOS&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F4423%2Fhead&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16555471" author="dpavlov" created="Wed, 25 Jul 2018 10:01:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=EdShangGG&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;EdShangGG&quot;&gt;EdShangGG&lt;/a&gt; could you please explain why this change has effect?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;org.apache.ignite.testframework.junits.GridAbstractTest#getFailureHandler&lt;br/&gt;
defines failure handler as NoOpFailureHandler.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So I don&apos;t understand why change &lt;br/&gt;
  cfg.setFailureHandler(new NoOpFailureHandler());&lt;br/&gt;
has effect&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16555506" author="edshanggg" created="Wed, 25 Jul 2018 10:39:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Because we don&apos;t use getConfiguration result of parents and create configuration from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16555635" author="dpavlov" created="Wed, 25 Jul 2018 13:20:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=EdShangGG&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;EdShangGG&quot;&gt;EdShangGG&lt;/a&gt;, thank you for clarification, I&apos;ve missed what we ignore config from base class.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Merged to master. Thank you for contribution.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
